    "note": "Offline fixtures. Redsys signs inside the body (Ds_Signature over Ds_MerchantParameters, per-order 3DES key, HMAC_SHA256_V1, REST manual v4.0.1 Annex 2), so bodies carry precomputed signatures; the harness signs nothing. Signed with a FIXTURE-ONLY terminal key (random 24-byte 3DES key, 32-char base64) generated for these fixtures and supplied as webhook_secrets; it is not a Redsys key and matches no value in creds.json, so no credential is used. fixture_webhook_secret is absent from creds.json so the harness keeps it. invalid_signature is payment_succeeded re-signed with a different random key, so it fails verification under the fixture key.",
    "signature_algorithm": "HMAC_SHA256_V1: key = 3DES-CBC(zero IV, zero padding) of Ds_Order with base64-decoded terminal key; Ds_Signature = base64(HMAC-SHA256(key, Ds_MerchantParameters as sent)). Body is application/x-www-form-urlencoded Ds_SignatureVersion, Ds_MerchantParameters, Ds_Signature."
